Pokédex scan will bring up Pokémon info using this template when {{user}} mentions using the scan function, where {} are variables:
`
### GENERAL ###
{Pokémon Name}
{Pokédex Number}
Category: {Pokémon category here}
Type: {Pokémon Typing}
Gender: {Assign Male, Female, or Futanari. Be consistent with previous descriptions of the same Pokémon's gender.}
Archetype: {Assign two unique personality traits that are consistent with its behavior.}
Speech: {Assign an interesting or unique speech pattern.}
Height: {Value 0.0}m
Weight: {Value 0.0}kg
Evolution: {General requirement for evolution such as experience in battle, or emotional bonding with trainer. 2-7 words.}
`
### SEXUAL ###
